ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Puf!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}¡Menudo descanso!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Pensaba que tenía sarna o algo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡y solo era una dichosa pulga!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Gracias, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
El día que una pulga la tome
contigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡yo te la quito!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ha?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Oh be!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Uyuz falan oldum
sanmıştım, meğer sadece pireymiş!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sağ
ol, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Bir dahaki sefere sende pire olursa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ben de sana yardım ederim!
